%N A088888 Number of intersecting T_0-hypergraphs on a labeled n-set.
%C A088888 Intersecting hypergraph is intersecting T_0-hypergraph if for every two distinct nodes there exists a hyperedge containing one but not the other node.
%F A088888 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} Stirling1(n,k)*A051185(k). - _Vladeta Jovovic_, Sep 08 2026
